      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿6",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 2308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好刺眼！！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 2320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D523A773CFF01FF0100100002011401D60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你还好吗？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 2340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F608FD8597D5417FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "发生什么事了？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 2352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53D1751F4EC04E484E8B4E86FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎呀……说来惭愧，\n迭失棺在密阿雷是很稀有的宝可梦……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我找到它的时候实在太激动了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 2368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CE5440202620268BF4676560ED6127FF0C000A8FED593168FA57285BC6963F96F7662F5F887A00670976845B9D53EF68A62026202600100001BE00000A6211627E52305B83768465F650195B9E5728592A6FC052A84E86300200100002011401D60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以我就忘乎所以地大闹了一通，\n但这好像吵到迭失棺了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 2468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE562115C315FD84E4E62404EE55730592795F94E864E00901AFF0C000A4F468FD9597D50CF543552308FED593168FA4E86300200100002011401D60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "结果我就被生起气的\n迭失棺吞了进去。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 2532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7ED3679C62115C3188AB751F8D776C147684000A8FED593168FA541E4E868FDB53BB300200100002011401D60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "里面睡起来实在是太舒服了，\n我差点都要睡沉了呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 2580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "91CC976277618D7767655B9E5728662F592A8212670D4E86FF0C000A62115DEE70B990FD898177616C894E865462300200100002011401D60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "总之，非常感谢你们\n把我放出来！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 2640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "603B4E4BFF0C975E5E38611F8C224F604EEC000A628A6211653E51FA6765FF0100100002011401D60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "可能有人被关在\n迭失棺的身体里了。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n快给我去找迭失棺。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 2684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EF80FD67094EBA88AB51735728000A8FED593168FA76848EAB4F5391CC4E86300200100001BE01000A5FEB7ED9621153BB627E8FED593168FA3002001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿@",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 2756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00400000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哟，\n你干得很好嘛！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 2768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54DFFF0C000A4F605E725F975F88597D561BFF01001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "发出惨叫的那个人没事就好。\n还真是干了件大好事啊！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 2800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53D151FA60E853EB768490A34E2A4EBA6CA14E8B5C31597D3002000A8FD8771F662F5E724E864EF65927597D4E8B554AFF01001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "成功帮密阿雷做了件好事，\n你也感觉很棒吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 2860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6210529F5E2E5BC6963F96F7505A4E864EF6597D4E8BFF0C000A4F604E5F611F89C95F8868D25427FF01001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你真该感谢一下当初\n找上你的本大爷啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 2912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60771F8BE5611F8C224E004E0B5F53521D000A627E4E0A4F607684672C59277237554A3002001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你身后……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 69,
      "offsetInSection": 2960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F608EAB540E202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你这样可是会被吞掉的",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 70,
      "offsetInSection": 2972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F608FD9683753EF662F4F1A88AB541E638976840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 71,
      "offsetInSection": 2996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554AFF1F001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "呜呀～～～～！！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 72,
      "offsetInSection": 3012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "545C5440FF5EFF5EFF5EFF5EFF01FF01001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    }
